hcc2d-streamer (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging release of the single-file C Streamer.
  * Support QR, HCC2D4, and HCC2D8 symbol streams.
  * Add lossless animated GIF export with integer module scaling.

